notes:        Used here: applied by variant identifier-09-preset-channel-id of aep/1300-thirdparty.aep. Made by hand in Adobe After Effects 2026 (26.2.1x2) on Windows 11 on 2026-11-05 (the settings cannot be made by script): add the effect to a layer of a 320 x 180 composition (a coloured solid for Lumetri Color, the EXR layer for the others), set it as described, select the effect, Animation > Save Animation Preset, delete the effect (docs/aep/2026-11-05-importer-samples.md). It contains only that one effect with the values set by hand; no Adobe preset, sample or bundled asset was used or copied. XMP packet of After Effects (creator tool, timestamps, random document ids) only; no ICC profile, no paths or personal names (tools/aep/inspect-embedded.py: CLEAN). Its Channel Info record was checked for leftovers of uninitialised memory: none (scrub-uninit.py changes nothing in this file).
